---
sequenceDiagram
  actor U as Authorized caller
  participant W as OCE API / worker<br/>IAM, State, Work, Compute
  participant I as Native Gateway ingress
  participant O as OpenShell runtime
  participant C as Original credential owners<br/>Repository service / model adapter
  Note over U,C: Proposed lifecycle — starts at admitted Agent deployment
  Note over U,W: 1. Admit and prepare
  U->>W: Save Agent and request exact-Agent deploy
  W-->>U: 202 admission, revision-read status
  Note over W,C: Protected acquisition waits for genuine requester, execution and receiving evidence
  W->>C: Original owner prepares session once
  C-->>W: Private binding and retained attempt
  W->>O: Compute prepares mediation for bound revision
  O-->>W: Safe lease and mediation status
  Note over U,C: 2. Authenticate and dispatch
  U->>I: Authorized native Gateway request
  I->>O: Bound operation and current owner evidence
  alt Wrong scope, destination or missing protected evidence
    O-->>I: Not dispatched, safe refusal
    I-->>U: Refusal without credentials
  else Admitted exact operation
    O->>C: Git to OCE HTTPS service or Responses to model adapter
    C->>C: Validate plan, privately attach authentication
    C-->>O: Bounded response or uncertain original attempt
    O-->>I: Bound exchange result, safe audit correlation
    I-->>U: Operation result, separate provider readback
  end
  Note over W,C: 3. Withdraw admission and active traffic
  W->>O: Authority withdrawal or renewal loss
  O->>C: Stop new dispatch and close active Git/model traffic
  C-->>W: Closure observation or pending original attempt
  Note over W,C: Protected total at most 30 seconds including detection, with selected stricter bounds
  Note over W,C: 4. Dispose through original owners
  W->>O: Dispose exact owned attachments
  O->>C: Original-owner cleanup and settlement
  C-->>W: Disposed or cleanup pending, never reopen admission
  Note over W,C: Lost inventory remains unknown, uncertain dispatch never automatically replays
  Note over U,C: End at confirmed closure and truthful owned-cleanup disposition
